WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.410
My team and I turn coaches, authors, and
influencers into money-making machines.

00:06.460 --> 00:09.130
I livestream on the
internet one hour a day.

00:09.180 --> 00:11.150
It's called Funnel Hacking Live.

00:11.200 --> 00:12.980
Funnel hacking is where I go online like

00:13.000 --> 00:16.170
a consumer and walk your
entire customer journey.

00:16.220 --> 00:17.770
I find you online.

00:17.820 --> 00:19.910
I really like what you have to say.

00:19.960 --> 00:22.850
I'd love to buy something from you.

00:22.900 --> 00:25.830
75 percent of the time, I can't.

00:25.880 --> 00:28.820
You send me to your Facebook
page or your Instagram page.

00:28.840 --> 00:30.570
You don't have a website.

00:30.620 --> 00:32.050
You don't have a product.

00:32.100 --> 00:33.910
Here's what that costs you.

00:33.960 --> 00:38.910
The smallest package any client of
mine sells is ten thousand dollars.

00:38.960 --> 00:43.090
So when your opportunity comes and you get in front
of a large audience with nothing to offer them,

00:43.140 --> 00:46.630
you just left hundreds of
thousands of dollars on the table.

00:46.680 --> 00:47.500
I fix that.

00:47.840 --> 00:50.960
We package your intellectual
property and we drive the

00:50.980 --> 00:54.540
attention you generate to a
website you own and control.

00:54.560 --> 00:59.100
So the next time you get a speaking
engagement or your next big opportunity,

00:59.120 --> 01:02.330
you can capitalize on it.

01:02.380 --> 01:04.330
I wrote a book about our process.

01:04.380 --> 01:07.150
It's called Attention To Dollars.

01:07.200 --> 01:10.610
Attention plus your
product equals dollars.

01:10.660 --> 01:12.570
There are three ways to work with us.

01:12.620 --> 01:15.830
Do it yourself, done with
you, or done for you.

01:15.880 --> 01:17.210
You're in the right place.

01:17.260 --> 01:17.920
Have a look around.

01:18.380 --> 01:19.580
I look forward to talking.

